[145.94456, "o", "## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n"]
[145.944689, "o", "\r\n"]
[145.944739, "o", "Controller memo (binding reconciliation rule):\r\n"]
[145.944781, "o", "\r\n"]
[145.944832, "o", "The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices\r\n"]
[145.94488, "o", "target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically\r\n"]
[145.944938, "o", "greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in\r\n"]
[145.945321, "o", "`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice\r\n"]
[145.945389, "o", "applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override\r\n"]
[145.945437, "o", "both ledger owners and signed meeting amendments when applied in this step.\r\n"]
[145.945483, "o", "\r\n"]
[145.94553, "o", "## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — field notes\r\n"]
[145.945576, "o", "\r\n"]
