[232.61527, "o", "apital project capitalization. Finance operations pushed back, arguing the issue was transient cache state; QA reproduced the drift on a cold run the next morning.\r\n    63\t\r\n    64\tMemo WP-9453 summarizes stakeholder interviews about capital project capitalization. Participants disagreed on whether unsigned amendments should ever override ledger owners; Brief 05 resolves that question for the extractor.\r\n    65\t\r\n    66\tFollow-up #800 confirmed that fixed assets had been using an informal spreadsheet for capital project capitalization. The formal extractor must instead derive rows only from the canonical ledger and structured sections at file end.\r\n    67\t\r\n    68\tSite visit #428 to fixed assets captured mailbox exports showing how capital project capitalization correspondence arrived between two correction batches. Reviewers flagged the gap because effective-date logic must honor notice precedence.\r\n    69\t\r\n    70\tRisk assessment WP-8147 ties capital project capitalization to control deficiencies around mai"]
