[280.364226, "o", "\r\n--- context starting at line 254 ---\r\n254: Auditor directive (mandatory for extract):\r\n255: \r\n256: Interview notes with the compliance desk confirmed status fights between mail,\r\n257: amendments, and corrections. Ledger rows provide the base status (lowercase on\r\n258: output). Status precedence from lowest to highest is: pending, approved,\r\n259: rejected, reversed. Email excerpts may change status only when the From line\r\n260: contains `compliance@` anywhere in the address; ignore all other senders.\r\n"]
[280.364296, "o", "261: \r\n"]
